## Codebase Patterns
- The component uses `WebComponent.create('image-editor')` for registration.
- Authored light-DOM content is captured in `connectedCallback()` before the
  base class invokes `render()`.
- Corner affordances keep their cursor direction in the rendered handle style
  as well as the stylesheet, so the direction remains observable and stable
  during later pointer interaction work.

